WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.455 --> 00:00:03.006
- This country of the
United States was not built

00:00:03.006 --> 00:00:05.634
by those who waited and rested

00:00:05.634 --> 00:00:06.924
and wished to look behind them.

00:00:06.924 --> 00:00:10.341
Ask not what your country can do for you,

00:00:11.754 --> 00:00:14.222
ask what you can do for your country.

00:00:14.222 --> 00:00:17.648
All we have built, all we have worked for

00:00:17.648 --> 00:00:20.157
would be destroyed in the first 24 hours.

00:00:20.157 --> 00:00:24.843
There are some who say
that communism is the wave

00:00:24.843 --> 00:00:28.093
of the future, let them come to Berlin.

00:00:29.197 --> 00:00:30.613
- He was an American Politician who served

00:00:30.613 --> 00:00:34.411
as the 35th President of the
United States of America.

00:00:34.411 --> 00:00:39.122
He was assassinated in Dallas,
Texas on November 22nd, 1963.

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:41.632
He continues to rank highly
in polls of the general

00:00:41.632 --> 00:00:43.882
public and historians
as one of the greatest

00:00:43.882 --> 00:00:46.474
Presidents of all time,
he's John F Kennedy.

00:00:46.474 --> 00:00:49.226
And here's my take on his
top 10 rules of success.

00:00:49.226 --> 00:00:51.352
Rule Number Two is my personal
favorite and I'm curious

00:00:51.352 --> 00:00:53.191
to figure out which one
you guys like the best

00:00:53.191 --> 00:00:55.571
and as always, as he's
talking and he says something

00:00:55.571 --> 00:00:58.203
really meaningful then
that resonates with you,

00:00:58.203 --> 00:01:00.337
please leave it in the
comments below and put quotes

00:01:00.337 --> 00:01:04.177
around it so other people can
be inspired as well, enjoy.

00:01:04.177 --> 00:01:07.341
(whooshing)
(bouncing ball)

00:01:07.341 --> 00:01:10.174
(uplifting music)

00:01:17.418 --> 00:01:22.354
- Surely the opening vistas
of space promise high costs

00:01:22.354 --> 00:01:26.062
and hardships as well as higher reward.

00:01:26.062 --> 00:01:30.319
So it is not surprising
that some would have us stay

00:01:30.319 --> 00:01:34.236
where we are a little
longer, to rest, to wait.

00:01:35.241 --> 00:01:37.489
But this city of Houston,
this state of Texas,

00:01:37.489 --> 00:01:41.749
this country of the United
States was not built by those

00:01:41.749 --> 00:01:46.095
who waited and rested and
wished to look behind them.

00:01:46.095 --> 00:01:48.345
(applause)

00:01:55.492 --> 00:01:58.418
This country was conquered by those who

00:01:58.418 --> 00:02:01.001
move forward and so will space.

00:02:01.888 --> 00:02:06.055
In the long history of the
world, only a few generations

00:02:07.797 --> 00:02:12.301
have been granted to
role of defending freedom

00:02:12.301 --> 00:02:15.064
in it's hour of maximum danger.

00:02:15.064 --> 00:02:18.908
I do not shrink from this
responsibility, I welcome it.

00:02:18.908 --> 00:02:21.158
(cheering)

00:02:24.344 --> 00:02:28.511
I do not believe that any
of us would exchange places

00:02:29.861 --> 00:02:34.373
with any other people
or any other generation.

00:02:34.373 --> 00:02:38.540
The energy, the faith, the
devotion, which we bring to

00:02:39.597 --> 00:02:43.764
this endeavor will light our
country and all who serve it.

00:02:45.409 --> 00:02:49.576
And the glow from that fire
can truly light the world.

00:02:51.382 --> 00:02:55.549
And so my fellow Americans,
ask now what your country can

00:02:57.520 --> 00:03:01.520
do for you, ask what you
can do for your country.

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:04.853
(cheering and applause)

00:03:08.907 --> 00:03:13.074
My fellow citizens of the
world, ask not what America

00:03:14.801 --> 00:03:18.103
will do for you but what together

00:03:18.103 --> 00:03:21.197
we can do for the freedom of man.

00:03:21.197 --> 00:03:23.447
(cheering)

00:03:25.754 --> 00:03:29.421
Finally, whether you
are citizens of America

00:03:30.524 --> 00:03:34.691
or citizens of the world,
ask of us here the same high

00:03:37.196 --> 00:03:41.363
standards of strength and
sacrifice which we ask of you.

00:03:43.847 --> 00:03:48.014
With a good conscience,
our only sure reward, with

00:03:49.656 --> 00:03:54.254
history the final judge
of our deeds, let us go

00:03:54.254 --> 00:03:58.421
forth to lead the land we
love, asking his blessing

00:04:00.064 --> 00:04:03.814
and his help, but knowing
that here on earth,

00:04:04.989 --> 00:04:07.739
God's work much truly be our own.

00:04:08.829 --> 00:04:13.589
Some say that it is useless
to speak of peace or world

00:04:13.589 --> 00:04:17.756
law or world disarmament
and that it will be useless

00:04:18.885 --> 00:04:22.392
until the leaders of the
Soviet Union adopt a more

00:04:22.392 --> 00:04:26.228
enlightened attitude, I hope they do.

00:04:26.228 --> 00:04:28.768
I believe we can help them do it.

00:04:28.768 --> 00:04:32.992
But I also believe that we must
reexamine our own attitudes,

00:04:32.992 --> 00:04:36.384
as individuals and as a nation.

00:04:36.384 --> 00:04:40.023
For our attitude is as
essential as theirs.

00:04:40.023 --> 00:04:43.409
And every Graduate of this
school, every thoughtful

00:04:43.409 --> 00:04:47.576
citizen who despairs of war
and wishes to bring peace

00:04:50.177 --> 00:04:53.979
should begin by looking
inward, by examining his own

00:04:53.979 --> 00:04:58.028
attitude towards the
possibilities of peace, towards

00:04:58.028 --> 00:05:02.878
the Soviet Union, towards
the course of the Cold War

00:05:02.878 --> 00:05:06.222
and towards freedom
and peace here at home.

00:05:06.222 --> 00:05:10.100
First examine our attitude
towards peace itself.

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:12.984
Too many of us think it is impossible.

00:05:12.984 --> 00:05:16.033
Too many think it is unreal but that

00:05:16.033 --> 00:05:18.783
is a dangerous, defeatist belief.

00:05:19.791 --> 00:05:24.337
It leads to the conclusion
that war is inevitable.

00:05:24.337 --> 00:05:28.599
That mankind is doomed, that
we are gripped by forces

00:05:28.599 --> 00:05:32.599
we cannot control, we
need not accept that view.

00:05:34.116 --> 00:05:38.132
Our problems are man made,
therefore they can be solved

00:05:38.132 --> 00:05:41.549
by man and man can be as big as he wants.

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:47.966
No problem of human destiny
is beyond human beings.

00:05:47.966 --> 00:05:52.891
Man's reason and spirit have
often solved the seemingly

00:05:52.891 --> 00:05:56.277
unsolvable and we believe
they can do it again.

00:05:56.277 --> 00:06:00.444
By why some say the moon,
why choose this as our goal?

00:06:01.747 --> 00:06:06.255
And they may well ask, why
climb the highest mountain?

00:06:06.255 --> 00:06:09.255
Why, 35 years ago, fly the Atlantic?

00:06:10.232 --> 00:06:14.399
Why does Rice play Texas,
we choose to go to the moon.

00:06:15.362 --> 00:06:19.529
We choose to go to the moon.
(cheering)

00:06:23.226 --> 00:06:26.126
We choose to go to the moon in this decade

00:06:26.126 --> 00:06:29.512
and do the other things,
not because they are easy

00:06:29.512 --> 00:06:33.726
but because they are hard,
because that goal will

00:06:33.726 --> 00:06:37.739
serve to organize and measure
the best of our energies

00:06:37.739 --> 00:06:41.663
and skills because that challenge
is one that we're willing

00:06:41.663 --> 00:06:45.791
to accept, one we are
unwilling to postpone

00:06:45.791 --> 00:06:49.379
and one we tend to win and the others too.

00:06:49.379 --> 00:06:52.629
We observe today not a victory of party

00:06:54.814 --> 00:06:58.981
but a celebration of freedom,
symbolizing an end as well

00:07:00.376 --> 00:07:04.543
as a beginning, signifying
renewal as well as change.

00:07:07.358 --> 00:07:11.025
For I have sworn before
you and Almighty God

00:07:12.287 --> 00:07:16.204
the same solemn oath,
our forbearers prescribed

00:07:18.133 --> 00:07:22.055
nearly a century and three quarters ago.

00:07:22.055 --> 00:07:25.548
The world is very different now.

00:07:25.548 --> 00:07:29.858
For man holds in his
mortal hands, the power to

00:07:29.858 --> 00:07:33.858
abolish all forms of human
poverty and all forms

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:39.737
of human life and yet the
same revolutionary beliefs

00:07:42.717 --> 00:07:46.853
for which our forebearers
fought are still an issue

00:07:46.853 --> 00:07:51.020
around the globe, the belief
that the rights of man

00:07:52.512 --> 00:07:53.793
come not from the generosity of the

00:07:53.793 --> 00:07:56.376
state but from the hand of God.

00:07:58.518 --> 00:08:01.904
We dare not forget the day that we

00:08:01.904 --> 00:08:05.750
are the heirs of that first revolution.

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:09.583
Let the word go forth
from this time and place

00:08:10.474 --> 00:08:14.641
to friend and foe alike that
the torch has been passed

00:08:16.205 --> 00:08:20.372
to a new generation of
Americans born in this century,

00:08:22.563 --> 00:08:26.730
tempered by war, disciplined
by a hard and bitter peace,

00:08:29.119 --> 00:08:33.286
proud of our ancient heritage
and unwilling to witness

00:08:34.386 --> 00:08:38.386
or permit the slow undoing
of those human rights

00:08:42.242 --> 00:08:46.756
to which this nation has
always been committed to which

00:08:46.756 --> 00:08:50.923
we are committed to day at
home and around the world.

00:08:52.311 --> 00:08:54.561
(cheering)

00:08:58.491 --> 00:09:02.658
Let every nation know whether
it wishes us well or ill,

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:10.367
that we shall pay any
price, bear any burden, meet

00:09:12.838 --> 00:09:16.838
any hardship, support any
friend, oppose any foe

00:09:20.328 --> 00:09:24.049
to assure the survival and
the success of liberty.

00:09:24.049 --> 00:09:27.141
- We are confronted
primarily with a moral issue.

00:09:27.141 --> 00:09:30.439
It is as old as the
scriptures and as clear as

00:09:30.439 --> 00:09:33.861
the American Constitution,
the heart of the question

00:09:33.861 --> 00:09:38.375
is whether all Americans are
to be afforded equal rights

00:09:38.375 --> 00:09:41.970
and equal opportunities,
whether we are going to treat

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:45.360
our fellow Americans as
we want to be treated.

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:49.622
If an American, because
his skin is dark cannot eat

00:09:49.622 --> 00:09:53.586
lunch in a restaurant open
to the public, if he cannot

00:09:53.586 --> 00:09:58.131
send his children to the
best public school available,

00:09:58.131 --> 00:10:01.599
if he cannot vote for the
public officials who represent

00:10:01.599 --> 00:10:05.771
him, if in short, he cannot
enjoy the full and free life

00:10:05.771 --> 00:10:09.575
which all of us want,
then who among us would be

00:10:09.575 --> 00:10:11.963
content to have the color of his

00:10:11.963 --> 00:10:14.963
skin changed and stand in his place?

00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:18.856
Who among us would then be
content with the counsels

00:10:18.856 --> 00:10:23.023
of patience and delay, 100
years of delay have passed

00:10:24.832 --> 00:10:27.962
since President Lincoln freed the slaves.

00:10:27.962 --> 00:10:32.858
Yet their heirs, their
grandsons are not fully free.

00:10:32.858 --> 00:10:36.161
They are not yet free from
the bonds of injustice.

00:10:36.161 --> 00:10:40.328
They are not yet free from
social and economic oppression.

00:10:41.513 --> 00:10:46.443
And this nation, for all
its hopes and all its boasts

00:10:46.443 --> 00:10:50.742
will not be fully free until
all its citizens are free.

00:10:50.742 --> 00:10:53.958
It is discouraging to read
a recent authoritative

00:10:53.958 --> 00:10:57.966
Soviet text on military
strategy and find on page

00:10:57.966 --> 00:11:01.883
after page, holy baseless
and incredible claims

00:11:03.698 --> 00:11:07.454
such as the allegation that
American Imperialist Circles

00:11:07.454 --> 00:11:10.713
are preparing to unleash
different types of war,

00:11:10.713 --> 00:11:13.723
that there is a very real
threat of a preventative war

00:11:13.723 --> 00:11:16.607
being unleashed by American
Imperialists against the

00:11:16.607 --> 00:11:20.281
Soviet Union and that the
political aims and I quote,

00:11:20.281 --> 00:11:24.465
of the American Imperialist
are to enslave economically

00:11:24.465 --> 00:11:28.930
and politically the European
and other Capitalist countries

00:11:28.930 --> 00:11:31.434
and to achieve world domination

00:11:31.434 --> 00:11:34.854
by means of aggressive war, unquote.

00:11:34.854 --> 00:11:37.442
Truly as it was written long ago,

00:11:37.442 --> 00:11:40.525
the wicked flee when no man pursuith.

00:11:41.376 --> 00:11:44.839
Yet it is sad to read
these Soviet statements,

00:11:44.839 --> 00:11:48.181
to realize the extent
of the gulf between us.

00:11:48.181 --> 00:11:52.348
But it is also a warning, a
warning to the American people,

00:11:53.653 --> 00:11:57.117
not to fall into the
same trap as the Soviets,

00:11:57.117 --> 00:12:00.047
not to see only a distorted
and desperate view of the

00:12:00.047 --> 00:12:04.392
other side, not to see
conflict as inevitable,

00:12:04.392 --> 00:12:09.040
accommodation as impossible
and communication as nothing

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:11.790
more than an exchange of threats.

00:12:12.752 --> 00:12:16.604
No government or social
system is so evil that it's

00:12:16.604 --> 00:12:20.987
people must be considered
as lacking in virtue.

00:12:20.987 --> 00:12:25.713
As Americans we find Communism
profoundly repugnant,

00:12:25.713 --> 00:12:29.435
as a negation of personal
freedom and dignity.

00:12:29.435 --> 00:12:32.529
But we can still hail the
Russian people for their

00:12:32.529 --> 00:12:37.044
many achievements in Science
and Space and economic

00:12:37.044 --> 00:12:41.802
and industrial growth, in
culture, in acts of courage.

00:12:41.802 --> 00:12:44.518
Among the many traits the
peoples of our two countries

00:12:44.518 --> 00:12:48.108
have in common, none is
stronger than our mutual

00:12:48.108 --> 00:12:52.275
abhorrence of war, almost
unique among the major world

00:12:53.619 --> 00:12:57.469
powers, we have never been
at war with each other.

00:12:57.469 --> 00:13:01.061
And no nation in the history
of the battle ever suffered

00:13:01.061 --> 00:13:05.237
more than the Soviet Union
in the Second World War.

00:13:05.237 --> 00:13:08.075
At least 20 million lost their lives.

00:13:08.075 --> 00:13:11.960
Countless millions of homes
and families were burned

00:13:11.960 --> 00:13:16.506
or sacked, a third of the
nation's territory, including

00:13:16.506 --> 00:13:21.068
2/3rds of it's industrial base
was turned into a wasteland,

00:13:21.068 --> 00:13:22.944
a loss equivalent to the destruction

00:13:22.944 --> 00:13:26.040
of this country east of Chicago.

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:29.001
Today, should total war
every break out again,

00:13:29.001 --> 00:13:33.168
no matter how, our two countries
will be the primary target.

00:13:34.721 --> 00:13:38.353
It is an ironic, but accurate
fact that the two strongest

00:13:38.353 --> 00:13:42.520
powers are the two in the
most danger of devastation.

00:13:44.157 --> 00:13:48.330
All we have built, all
we have worked for would

00:13:48.330 --> 00:13:51.878
be destroyed in the first 24
hours and even in the Cold

00:13:51.878 --> 00:13:56.045
War, which brings burdens and
dangers to so many countries,

00:13:57.232 --> 00:14:00.862
including this nation's
closest allays, our

00:14:00.862 --> 00:14:03.955
two countries bear the heaviest burdens.

00:14:03.955 --> 00:14:08.887
For we are both devoting
massive sums of money to weapons

00:14:08.887 --> 00:14:11.061
that could be better devoted to

00:14:11.061 --> 00:14:14.903
combat ignorance, poverty and disease.

00:14:14.903 --> 00:14:19.845
We are both caught up in a
vicious and dangerous cycle

00:14:19.845 --> 00:14:24.060
with suspicion one side
breeding suspicion on the other.

00:14:24.060 --> 00:14:27.992
And new weapons begetting counter weapons.

00:14:27.992 --> 00:14:31.462
In short, both the United
States and its allays

00:14:31.462 --> 00:14:35.262
and the Soviet Union and
its allays have a mutually

00:14:35.262 --> 00:14:38.679
deep interest in a just and genuine peace

00:14:39.569 --> 00:14:42.203
and in holding the arms race.

00:14:42.203 --> 00:14:45.379
Agreements to this end are
in the interests of the

00:14:45.379 --> 00:14:47.879
Soviet Union, as well as ours.

00:14:48.971 --> 00:14:52.151
And even the most hostile
nations can be relied

00:14:52.151 --> 00:14:56.964
upon to accept and keep
those treaty obligations

00:14:56.964 --> 00:14:59.678
and only those treaty
obligations which are in

00:14:59.678 --> 00:15:03.524
their own interest so let
us not be blind to our

00:15:03.524 --> 00:15:07.964
differences but let us also
direct attention to our

00:15:07.964 --> 00:15:11.396
common interests and
the means by which those

00:15:11.396 --> 00:15:15.697
differences can be resolved
and if we cannot end now

00:15:15.697 --> 00:15:17.827
our differences, at least we can

00:15:17.827 --> 00:15:21.339
help make the world safe for diversity.

00:15:21.339 --> 00:15:24.931
For the separation of church
and state is absolute.

00:15:24.931 --> 00:15:28.309
For no Catholic fellow
would tell the President,

00:15:28.309 --> 00:15:31.109
should he be Catholic how to act.

00:15:31.109 --> 00:15:33.534
And now Protestant Minister would tell his

00:15:33.534 --> 00:15:36.344
parishioners for whom to vote.

00:15:36.344 --> 00:15:40.052
Where no church or church
school is granted any public

00:15:40.052 --> 00:15:44.192
funds or political preference
and where no man is

00:15:44.192 --> 00:15:48.283
denied public office
merely because his religion

00:15:48.283 --> 00:15:51.001
differs from the President
who might appoint him

00:15:51.001 --> 00:15:54.173
or the people who might elect him.

00:15:54.173 --> 00:15:57.637
I believe in an America
that is officially neither

00:15:57.637 --> 00:16:01.447
Catholic, Protestant, nor
Jewish, where no public

00:16:01.447 --> 00:16:05.127
official either requests
or accepts instructions

00:16:05.127 --> 00:16:07.928
on public policy from
the Pope, the National

00:16:07.928 --> 00:16:12.536
Counsel of Churches or any
other Ecclesiastical source.

00:16:12.536 --> 00:16:15.668
For no religious body
seeks to impose its will,

00:16:15.668 --> 00:16:19.668
directly or indirectly
upon the general populous

00:16:20.802 --> 00:16:24.939
or the public acts of its
officials and where religious

00:16:24.939 --> 00:16:29.079
liberty is so indivisible
that an act against one

00:16:29.079 --> 00:16:32.412
church is treated as an act against all.

00:16:33.759 --> 00:16:36.647
For while this year, it may
be a Catholic against who

00:16:36.647 --> 00:16:39.823
the finger of suspicion is pointed.

00:16:39.823 --> 00:16:43.584
In other years it has been
and may someday be again,

00:16:43.584 --> 00:16:47.417
a Jew or a Quaker or a
Unitarian or a Baptist.

00:16:49.138 --> 00:16:50.812
It was Virginia's Harassment of

00:16:50.812 --> 00:16:53.406
Baptist Preachers, for example that led

00:16:53.406 --> 00:16:56.832
to Jefferson's Statute
of Religious Freedom.

00:16:56.832 --> 00:17:01.141
Today I may be the victim,
but tomorrow it may be you.

00:17:01.141 --> 00:17:04.733
To those nations, who would
make themselves our adversary,

00:17:04.733 --> 00:17:08.900
we offer not a pledge but
a request that both sides

00:17:13.457 --> 00:17:16.554
begin anew the quest for peace.

00:17:16.554 --> 00:17:20.566
Before the dark towers
of destruction unleashed

00:17:20.566 --> 00:17:23.399
by science, engulf all humanity in

00:17:25.692 --> 00:17:28.942
planned or accidental self destruction.

00:17:29.916 --> 00:17:33.260
We dare not tempt them with weakness.

00:17:33.260 --> 00:17:37.427
For only when our arms are
sufficient beyond doubt

00:17:38.595 --> 00:17:41.521
can be we be certain
beyond doubt that they

00:17:41.521 --> 00:17:46.205
will never be employed
but neither can two great

00:17:46.205 --> 00:17:50.839
and powerful groups of
nations take comfort from

00:17:50.839 --> 00:17:55.006
our present course, both
sides overburdened by the cost

00:17:56.354 --> 00:18:00.521
of modern weapons, both
rightly alarmed by the steady

00:18:01.618 --> 00:18:05.701
spread of the deadly atom,
yet both racing toward

00:18:07.430 --> 00:18:11.189
that uncertain balance
of terror that stays

00:18:11.189 --> 00:18:13.689
the hand of mankind final war.

00:18:14.821 --> 00:18:18.738
So let us begin anew,
remembering on both sides

00:18:19.917 --> 00:18:23.477
that civility is not a sign of weakness

00:18:23.477 --> 00:18:27.570
and sincerity is always subject to proof.

00:18:27.570 --> 00:18:30.403
Let us never negotiate out of fear

00:18:31.284 --> 00:18:34.658
but let us never fear to negotiate.

00:18:34.658 --> 00:18:36.908
(cheering)

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:45.061
Let both sides explore
what problems unite us

00:18:45.061 --> 00:18:49.787
instead of belaboring those
problems which divide us.

00:18:49.787 --> 00:18:53.709
Let both sides for the
first time, formulate

00:18:53.709 --> 00:18:58.019
serious and precise
proposals for the inspection

00:18:58.019 --> 00:19:02.019
and control of arms and
bring the absolute power

00:19:02.866 --> 00:19:06.504
to destroy other nations
under the absolute

00:19:06.504 --> 00:19:10.671
control of all nations.
(applause)

00:19:13.892 --> 00:19:18.740
Let both sides seek to
invoke the wonders of science

00:19:18.740 --> 00:19:22.907
instead of it's terrors, together
let us explore the stars,

00:19:25.337 --> 00:19:29.504
conquer the deserts, eradicate
disease, tap the ocean

00:19:30.643 --> 00:19:34.143
depth and encourage the arts and commerce.

00:19:35.159 --> 00:19:39.326
Let both sides unite to heed
in all corners of the earth

00:19:40.504 --> 00:19:44.421
the command of Isaiah to
undo the heavy burdens

00:19:45.510 --> 00:19:49.677
and let the oppressed go
free and if a beach head of

00:19:52.494 --> 00:19:57.151
cooperation may push back
the jungle of suspicion,

00:19:57.151 --> 00:20:01.068
let both sides join in
creating a new endeavor,

00:20:02.501 --> 00:20:06.049
not a new balance of power but a new world

00:20:06.049 --> 00:20:08.716
of law where the strong are just

00:20:10.103 --> 00:20:13.853
and the weak, secure
and the peace preserved.

00:20:15.404 --> 00:20:19.571
All this will not be finished
in the first 100 days,

00:20:21.301 --> 00:20:25.526
nor will it be finished
in the first 1,000 days,

00:20:25.526 --> 00:20:30.216
nor in the life of this
administration, nor even perhaps

00:20:30.216 --> 00:20:34.216
in our lifetime on this
planet but let us begin.

00:20:35.476 --> 00:20:38.809
(applause and cheering)

00:20:43.097 --> 00:20:47.180
In your hands, my fellow
citizens, more than mine

00:20:48.687 --> 00:20:53.615
will rest the final success
or failure of our course.

00:20:53.615 --> 00:20:58.332
There are many people in
the world who really don't

00:20:58.332 --> 00:21:02.499
understand or say they don't,
what is the great issue

00:21:04.350 --> 00:21:08.267
between the free world
and the Communist world.

00:21:09.478 --> 00:21:13.645
Let them come to Berlin.
(cheering)

00:21:19.823 --> 00:21:23.656
There are some who say,
there are some who say

00:21:24.756 --> 00:21:28.500
that Communism is the wave of the future.

00:21:28.500 --> 00:21:32.667
Let them come to Berlin.
(cheering)

00:21:33.732 --> 00:21:37.899
And there are some who say
in Europe and elsewhere,

00:21:39.923 --> 00:21:43.803
we can work with the Communists,
let them come to Berlin.

00:21:43.803 --> 00:21:46.053
(cheering)

00:21:49.395 --> 00:21:53.395
And there are even a few
who say, that it's true

00:21:57.666 --> 00:22:00.333
that Communism is an evil system

00:22:01.348 --> 00:22:04.598
but it permits us to economic progress.

00:22:06.190 --> 00:22:08.904
Lass' sie nach Berlin kommen.

00:22:08.904 --> 00:22:13.071
Let them come to Berlin.
(loud cheering)

00:22:16.383 --> 00:22:20.550
Freedom has many difficulties
and Democracy is not perfect.

00:22:24.827 --> 00:22:27.457
But we have never had to
put a wall up to keep our

00:22:27.457 --> 00:22:30.636
people in, to prevent
them from leaving us.

00:22:30.636 --> 00:22:34.803
All free men, wherever
they may live, are citizens

00:22:36.182 --> 00:22:40.349
of Berlin and therefore,
as a free man, I take pride

00:22:42.542 --> 00:22:45.459
in the words, Ich bin ein Berliner.

00:22:46.813 --> 00:22:50.146
(cheering and applause)

00:23:04.778 --> 00:23:06.406
- Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:23:06.406 --> 00:23:09.124
I made this video because
Natalie Moses asked me to.

00:23:09.124 --> 00:23:10.960
So if there's a famous
entrepreneur that you want

00:23:10.960 --> 00:23:13.136
me to profile next, leave
it down in the comments

00:23:13.136 --> 00:23:14.602
below and I'll see what I can do.

00:23:14.602 --> 00:23:16.608
I'd also love to know
what did you learn in this

00:23:16.608 --> 00:23:19.324
video from JFK, what was
the best rule for you?

00:23:19.324 --> 00:23:21.740
What are you going to apply
to your business or your life?

00:23:21.740 --> 00:23:22.827
Please leave it in the comments

00:23:22.827 --> 00:23:24.961
and I'm going to join in the discussion.

00:23:24.961 --> 00:23:25.794
I also want to give a quick shout out to

00:23:25.794 --> 00:23:28.269
Antonio from Real Men Real Style.

00:23:28.269 --> 00:23:30.027
Antonio, thank you so much
for picking up a copy of

00:23:30.027 --> 00:23:32.113
my book and sending that tweet out.

00:23:32.113 --> 00:23:33.655
It really, really,
really means a lot to me

00:23:33.655 --> 00:23:35.282
that you support me, so
thank you guys so much

00:23:35.282 --> 00:23:36.741
for watching, I believe in you.

00:23:36.741 --> 00:23:38.993
I hope you continue to believe in yourself

00:23:38.993 --> 00:23:40.957
and whatever Your One Word is,

00:23:40.957 --> 00:23:43.593
much love, I'll see you soon.

00:23:43.593 --> 00:23:46.049
(whooshing)
(basketball dropping)

